  "description": "D-JAB Mountain Titanium Bike/Frame\n\nThe D-Jab (da harb) is known as a “powerful but wild spirit” which is the best way to describe the ride of the D-Jab Mountain Titanium Bike long-travel hardtail. Titanium is the material at the heart of this quick and comfortable hardtail mountain frame. The D-Jab has been redesigned with a move to 29\" wheels. Along with the new wheel size, the updated geometry also helps to create a stable and confidence inspiring platform for any rider that stands up to ride the D-JAB mountain bike like a real warrior. These updates have pushed the D-Jab to perform faster, more agile and ultimately more nimble. Enjoy the path you choose with the D-Jab as this bike is ready to conquer all lines put in its path.\n\nThe D-Jab is available in 3 colors: Raw Titanium, Black Stealth and Chameleon.\n\nThe D-Jab (da harb) is known as a “powerful but wild spirit” which is the best way to describe the ride of the D-Jab Mountain Titanium Bike long-travel hardtail.",
